                <pb facs="0837" n="829" sameAs="frus:frus1941v03/pg829"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/8782: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ankara</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-03-04T13:00:00+03:00">March 4, 1941—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>52. For Secretary and Under Secretary. From authoritative source I have confirmed
                    substantial accuracy of my 49, March 1, although I have not yet received fuller
                    details as to results of Eden mission.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
